# CODEOWNERS — path-based required review.
#
# Enforcement lives on the authenticated origin, not on this public distribution mirror,
# which accepts no outside commits. This file documents which paths require owner review.
#
# Handles are GitLab users/groups. NOTE: CODEOWNERS *enforcement* (blocking
# merges without owner approval) requires GitLab Premium; on Community Edition
# this file documents review-sensitive paths but is not auto-enforced. AGENTS.md
# mirrors this list as the agent forbidden-without-approval list — keep in sync.

# Global fallback — every change gets an owner review.
*                                   @Mosaera/engineering

# --- Security-sensitive paths (require explicit owner review) ---
/.github/                           @Mosaera/engineering
/.github/workflows/                 @Mosaera/engineering
/infra/                             @Mosaera/engineering
/docs/threat-models/                @Mosaera/engineering
/docs/adr/                          @Mosaera/engineering
/AGENTS.md                          @Mosaera/engineering
/.github/copilot-instructions.md    @Mosaera/engineering
/CODEOWNERS                         @Mosaera/engineering
/packages/policies/                 @Mosaera/engineering
/.claude/                           @Mosaera/engineering
/Makefile                           @Mosaera/engineering
/.gitlab-ci.yml                     @Mosaera/engineering
